---
const { currentLocale } = Astro;
const isIt = currentLocale === 'it';
---

<footer class="bg-[#4B9CD3] text-white py-12 mt-auto">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
		<div>
			<h3 class="text-white text-xl mb-4">Delogo – Cucina Greca</h3>
			<p class="text-blue-50 opacity-90">
				L'autentico sapore della Grecia profonda, nel cuore di Bologna.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-4">{isIt ? 'Contatti' : 'Contact'}</h4>
			<ul class="space-y-2 opacity-90">
				<li>Via Giovanna Zaccherini Alvisi 19/d, 40138 Bologna (BO)</li>
				<li><a href="tel:+39051245734" class="hover:underline" aria-label="Chiamaci al +39 051 245734">+39 051 245734</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div>
			<h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-4">{isIt ? 'Orari' : 'Hours'}</h4>
			<ul class="text-sm space-y-1 opacity-90">
				<li>Dom: 12:30–15:00, 19:30–22:30</li>
				<li>Lun: Chiuso</li>
				<li>Mar–Gio: 19:30–22:30</li>
				<li>Ven: 19:15–22:30</li>
				<li>Sab: 19:15–22:45</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-blue-400 text-center text-sm opacity-70">
		&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Delogo – Cucina Greca. Made with Astro v5.
	</div>
</footer>
